  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate - Drinking Water / Sanitation</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[size=000000]The Rural Water Accelerator is scaling 8-10 high-potential rural water businesses in Kenya, Uganda and possibly in Tanzania and Rwanda. The key objective is to make innovative rural water service providers investment ready and scale their operations to reach hundred-thousands or even millions of rural beneficiaries. The participating enterprises will develop an acceleration strategy, implement and recieve investments for an acceleration project, get in-depth coaching, technical assistance and will be matched with interested investors to create impact at scale. [/size]</narrative>
  </description>
